From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ville Takio <ville+git@takio.fi>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] b43: add B43_DFS to the local symbols

816-02 adds the B43_DFS option of the AC-PHY radar detection to b43's
Kconfig. Backports only passes on the symbols listed in local-symbols,
so list it next to B43_PHY_AC.

Signed-off-by: Ville Takio <ville+git@takio.fi>
---
 local-symbols | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/local-symbols
+++ b/local-symbols
@@ -194,6 +194,7 @@ B43_PHY_LP=
 B43_PHY_HT=
 B43_PHY_LCN=
 B43_PHY_AC=
+B43_DFS=
 B43_LEDS=
 B43_HWRNG=
 B43_DEBUG=
